{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"ae4d8718913c51e7","name":"card_event_decisive_defense","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Italy/events/card_event_decisive_defense","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"DECISIVE DEFENSE","text":"When a unit attacks your HQ, add a 6th ALPINI REGIMENT next to it defending.","flavorText":"The First Battle of Bir el Gubi was fought in Libya in November 1941, between the Italian and Commonwealth forces. The battle was fought during Operation Crusader which was an Allied attempt to bypass Axis defenses on the Egyptian-Libyan frontier and to relieve the Siege of Tobruk. The battle ended with an Italian victory and this was the first tank battle in North Africa where the Italians armored forces were victorious. A couple of weeks later the Commonwealth forces made another attempt to capture Bir el Gubi, in what is known as the Second Battle of Bir el Gubi, but again the Italian forces managed to repel the attacks. The Axis forces would later retreat from Bir el Gubi after continuous Allied attacks.","faction":"Italy","type":"gotcha","rarity":"Rare","cost":3,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"Name":"card_event_decisive_defense","title":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_event_decisive_defense_title","SourceString":"DECISIVE DEFENSE","LocalizedString":"DECISIVE DEFENSE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::gotcha","faction":"EFactionEnum::Italy","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_event_decisive_defense_text","SourceString":"When a unit attacks your HQ, add a 6th ALPINI REGIMENT next to it defending.","LocalizedString":"When a unit attacks your HQ, add a 6th ALPINI REGIMENT next to it defending."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_event_decisive_defense_history","SourceString":"The First Battle of Bir el Gubi was fought in Libya in November 1941, between the Italian and Commonwealth forces. The battle was fought during Operation Crusader which was an Allied attempt to bypass Axis defenses on the Egyptian-Libyan frontier and to relieve the Siege of Tobruk. The battle ended with an Italian victory and this was the first tank battle in North Africa where the Italians armored forces were victorious. A couple of weeks later the Commonwealth forces made another attempt to capture Bir el Gubi, in what is known as the Second Battle of Bir el Gubi, but again the Italian forces managed to repel the attacks. The Axis forces would later retreat from Bir el Gubi after continuous Allied attacks.","LocalizedString":"The First Battle of Bir el Gubi was fought in Libya in November 1941, between the Italian and Commonwealth forces. The battle was fought during Operation Crusader which was an Allied attempt to bypass Axis defenses on the Egyptian-Libyan frontier and to relieve the Siege of Tobruk. The battle ended with an Italian victory and this was the first tank battle in North Africa where the Italians armored forces were victorious. A couple of weeks later the Commonwealth forces made another attempt to capture Bir el Gubi, in what is known as the Second Battle of Bir el Gubi, but again the Italian forces managed to repel the attacks. The Axis forces would later retreat from Bir el Gubi after continuous Allied attacks."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isReserved":true,"usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardAttackSwitchTarget"],"spawnCardName":"card_unit_6th_alpini_regiment","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Class_Specific_Engineer_Socket_Crank_Sequence_2'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Class_Specific/War_UI_Class_Specific_Engineer_Socket_Crank_Sequence_2.0"},"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Organic_War_Drums_2'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Organic_War_Drums_2.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Italy/t_lion_for_a_day.t_lion_for_a_day","SubPathString":""},"historyPhoto":{"AssetPat